## APIs and how to reach them
- **SQL** (port `{{PORT}}`, service `{{SERVICE}}`) — python-oracledb, node-oracledb,
  JDBC, ODP.NET, godror, SQLcl. See `python-oracledb.py`, `jdbc-java.java`, ….
- **MongoDB-compatible API** (port `{{MONGO_PORT}}`) — mongosh, PyMongo, the Node
  mongodb driver. TLS on by default. See `mongosh.sh`, `pymongo.py`, ….
- **REST / SODA for REST / GraphQL** (`{{ORDS_URL}}`) — any HTTP client. See
  `ords-rest.sh`.

## Files in this kit
Each file is a ready-to-run connection snippet for one language/platform, with the
values above already filled in.

